how do you know what business you should  start it's one of the most common  questions I get asked and again I got  asked it in a different form from one of  our YouTube viewers Ronald who wrote  insane how do you know what you really  wanted how did you learn how you could  help people  how did you sort out all your ideas  feelings and find the one that was most  important to you so thanks for the  question Ronald it's a great question to  really spend time thinking about because  too many entrepreneurs start just trying  to make money and if your goal and  business is just to make money you're  gonna fail the guys who started business  just trying to make money almost never  do you have to start a business around  something that you're deeply passionate  about and something that you know really  helps people how did I find what I like  to do what I love to do the story like  the towel is after I sold my first  business I was asked a lot of speaking  people wanted me to come and help their  group of entrepreneurs and I remember  doing one of my first events was with  the YMCA and they promoted this event I  promoted and I spent a couple of weeks  preparing and I was gonna help change  the lives of these people who are coming  out to this event and I remember walking  through the building all excited ready  to go with my presentation going up the  elevators going into the room big room  full of chairs and everything stopped  for me for a second because I walked  into that room and there were only three  people who showed up  and I took a deep breath you know cuz  that sucked to do all that promotion and  preparation for only three people to  show up but I did my presentation and I  helped those three people that day help  change their lives change how they think  and while most people might have thought  of that as a failure I loved it  there was something about it I just  loved to do when I knew I had to go and  do it again and even if I wasn't making  money doing it I have to find a way to  keep doing it I take a job on just so I  can keep doing it again and that's how  you know if you're on the right path if  you look at any famous entrepreneur and  how they got started at the core is a  deep love for what they do and they had  failure after failure after failure in  terms of business making it a success  but they kept going because they loved  it so you've got to find that thing that  you love to do that you would do even if  you weren't making money it makes you  feel good it makes you want to help  people you makes me want to do it again  that's how you know you're on the right  path it's got to be a combination of  something that you love doing that also  helps people in a very meaningful way if  you can combine that you're gonna be  unstoppable don't just jump into an idea  because you think you can make a lot of  money out of it you're gonna end up  quitting in a couple months losing a lot  of money on it losing a lot of time  being frustrated and angry it's gotta be  something around an idea that you deeply  believe in and that you know helps  people it's a great question thank you  for asking for it I hope you guys  watching it will take it into  consideration when you're planning your  business for those of you watching if  you did like it this video please give  it a thumbs up  I love seeing those coming it makes me  want to do more and if you have a  question for your own business  feel free leave it in the comment  section below I always read those I love  seeing that come in so thank you and  I'll see you on the next episode
 

